{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43306","headline":"恩赐魏文贞公诸孙旧第以导直臣 · 裴大章","name":"恩赐魏文贞公诸孙旧第以导直臣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邢茅虽旧锡，邸第是初荣。\n迹往伤遗事，恩深感直声。\n云孙方庆袭，池馆忽春生。\n古甃开泉井，新禽绕画楹。\n自然垂带砺，况复激忠贞。\n必使千年後，长书竹帛名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴大章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}